00:14:41.423 --> 00:14:42.508
Welcome home.


00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:48.263
Babe, can I put this here?


00:14:48.347 --> 00:14:49.181
You hate it.


00:14:49.264 --> 00:14:50.098
No.


00:14:51.475 --> 00:14:53.435
New York City.


00:14:54.561 --> 00:14:57.064
